    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "10 Waterside, Ringaphuca, Dungarvan, Co. Waterford\r\nEircode: X35 TY40\r\nDenise Radley Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market this exceptional detached five-bedroom family home, extending to approximately 1,500 sq. ft. and presented in immaculate condition both internally and externally.\r\nNo. 10 Waterside is the home you have been waiting for. Built approximately nine years ago, this impressive modern home is bright, spacious and exceptionally energy efficient.\r\nThe property currently holds an A3 BER rating and benefits from air-to-water heating. Since purchasing the property, the current owners have further enhanced its energy efficiency with the installation of solar panels and an EV car charger.\r\nThe property occupies a particularly attractive and private position within a quiet cul-de-sac in the popular Waterside development and enjoys lovely views towards the estuary.\r\nDungarvan Town Centre is approximately five minutes away, with an excellent selection of schools, shops, sporting facilities, restaurants and everyday amenities within easy reach.\r\nAccommodation\r\nOn entering the property, a bright porch area allows an abundance of natural light to flow into the welcoming entrance hall.\r\nThe spacious living room is positioned to the front of the house and features a fitted stove, creating a warm and inviting living space. Double sliding doors connect the living room with the kitchen/dining area, creating a wonderful sense of space and flow throughout the ground floor.\r\nAlso positioned to the front of the property is a versatile fifth bedroom/second reception room. This is an excellent addition to the house and could equally be used as a home office, playroom or additional family room.\r\nThe kitchen/dining room is a particularly bright and spacious area and forms the heart of this beautiful home. It features a large fitted island in the centre of the kitchen, providing excellent preparation and seating space. Double doors open directly onto the rear garden, making this a wonderful area for family living and entertaining.\r\nA separate utility room provides additional fitted storage and has a door giving direct access to the rear garden.\r\nCompleting the ground-floor accommodation is a fully tiled bathroom with shower, W.C. and wash-hand basin.\r\nFirst Floor\r\nUpstairs, a spacious landing leads to four well-proportioned bedrooms.\r\nThe impressive master bedroom benefits from its own ensuite bathroom and walk-in wardrobe. There are three further bedrooms together with a beautifully finished, fully tiled family bathroom.\r\nAn electric Stira staircase provides convenient access to the attic, which has been floored to provide excellent additional storage space.\r\nOutside\r\nThe outdoor space at No. 10 is a real feature of this property and has been exceptionally well maintained.\r\nTo the front, the property has an attractive stone boundary wall, a beautifully finished entrance and off-street parking for two cars. An EV charger has also been installed.\r\nThe private rear garden has been thoughtfully landscaped to create an attractive yet low-maintenance outdoor space. It features mature planting, artificial grass and paved patio areas, providing several areas in which to sit, relax and enjoy the garden.\r\nThere is a Steeltech garden shed, together with an additional timber shed positioned to the left-hand side of the house, providing excellent external storage.\r\nThe rear garden is ideal for outdoor dining, entertaining and family use.\r\nNo. 10 Waterside offers an excellent combination of space, energy efficiency, modern accommodation and an exceptionally convenient location. With five bedrooms, three bathrooms, solar panels, air-to-water heating, an EV charger, beautiful gardens, estuary views and an immaculate interior, this is a superb turnkey family home.\r\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
